1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
She borrowed thirty thousand dollars.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,533
She paid every month for five years.

3
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:08,533
The balance was thirty-one thousand,
seven hundred and ninety.

4
00:00:08,533 --> 00:00:10,333
Nothing had gone wrong.

5
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:13,733
The interest billed more than she paid.

6
00:00:13,733 --> 00:00:16,200
The twenty-five dollar difference
was added back.

7
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,200
She was never repaying a loan.
She was renting money.

8
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,000
There is a contract where a loan
earns nothing. Qard hasan.
